{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-13-2","kind":"proposition","title":"大小比较：黄金分割与平方与比例","englishTitle":"If the square on a straight line be five times the square on a segment of it, then, when the double of the said segment is cut in extreme and mean ratio, the greater segment is the remaining part of the original straight line.","book":13,"number":2,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.2","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.2/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":2,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-13-2@raw-30e08735f5ddb824","contentId":"euclid-13-2","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"30e08735f5ddb824517dd384827a788e83aa1086ac5facbbe383057397a54509","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-13-2.statement","euclid-13-2.construction.1","euclid-13-2.construction.2","euclid-13-2.proof.1","euclid-13-2.proof.2","euclid-13-2.proof.3","euclid-13-2.proof.4","euclid-13-2.proof.5","euclid-13-2.proof.6","euclid-13-2.proof.7","euclid-13-2.proof.8","euclid-13-2.proof.9","euclid-13-2.proof.10","euclid-13-2.proof.11","euclid-13-2.proof.12","euclid-13-2.proof.13","euclid-13-2.proof.14","euclid-13-2.proof.15","euclid-13-2.proof.16","euclid-13-2.proof.17","euclid-13-2.proof.18","euclid-13-2.conclusion","euclid-13-2.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-13-2.statement","contentId":"euclid-13-2","revisionId":"euclid-13-2@raw-30e08735f5ddb824","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a6288b7f119a86670ea8b80e33cca7364f380b265b2e54aa0f8612e18eeafb02","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If the square on a straight line be five times the square on a segment of it, then, when the double of the said segment is cut in extreme and mean ratio, the greater segment is the remaining part of the original straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果直线上的正方形是该段的5倍,那么当该段的两倍在黄金分割被削减时,较大的数量部分是原直线的剩余部分。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-2.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-13-2","revisionId":"euclid-13-2@raw-30e08735f5ddb824","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"716144cb37b5a800616671aa9d50dac2d5cf346d58314574eb7f979f30cc5552","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the square on the straight line AB be five times the square on the segment AC of it, and let CD be double of AC; I say that, when CD is cut in extreme and mean ratio, the greater segment is CB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果直线 AB上的正方形是第AC的5倍,CD是第AC的两倍;我说,如果在黄金分割削减CD,则数量较大的部分是CB。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-2.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-13-2","revisionId":"euclid-13-2@raw-30e08735f5ddb824","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9419974dbf649844dc19344d3da1f788749ec07fca95a8448c32aee733e3864b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the squares AF, CG be described on AB, CD respectively, let the figure in AF be drawn, and let BE be drawn through."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"分别对AB,CD和正方形,AF进行描述,对AF进行统计,对BE进行统计。（相关点与线段：CG）"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-2.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-13-2","revisionId":"euclid-13-2@raw-30e08735f5ddb824","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0cd2d708db399024d0c06685b5dca597d67a3d6330dafa92ed6194e6ebbad006","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since the square on BA is five times the square on AC, AF is five times AH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,BA正方形是AC正方形的5倍,AFAH正方形5倍"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-2.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-13-2","revisionId":"euclid-13-2@raw-30e08735f5ddb824","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9452f584ecd1afa8eab1c216a469d8a09e4dcb74b95dab0a4a69b2224a074fe3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the gnomon MNO is quadruple of AH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,曲尺形 MNO是AH的三倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-2.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-13-2","revisionId":"euclid-13-2@raw-30e08735f5ddb824","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5762ce440cab5091e72b6e5250355fb9b470b0090c0f978c3a0b62f6ecaebf44","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since DC is double of CA, therefore the square on DC is quadruple of the square on CA, that is, CG is quadruple of AH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"DC是CA的两倍, 所以DC的正方形是CA的三倍, 也就是说,CG是AH的三倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-2.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-13-2","revisionId":"euclid-13-2@raw-30e08735f5ddb824","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"938d659eb9a9d06db29cf31cfbd6589be1b9aa1965ba092edf5d8f1830748004","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the gnomon MNO was also proved quadruple of AH; therefore the gnomon MNO is equal to CG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但曲尺形 MNO也证明是AH三倍,因此曲尺形 MNO等于CG。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-2.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-13-2","revisionId":"euclid-13-2@raw-30e08735f5ddb824","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"00096ebd5c1e13fa43ee1cef4ddd564ce236715a4974b6d62904fe4ebb52d300","citations":["euclid-6-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since DC is double of CA, while DC is equal to CK, and AC to CH, therefore KB is also double of BH. [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于DC是CA的两倍,DC等于CK,AC至CH,因此KB也是BH的两倍。 [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-2.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-13-2","revisionId":"euclid-13-2@raw-30e08735f5ddb824","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cf8bce8c4255c715cabb09b02dee3f2aa1b24b5d0290fa51af04b249b1bbbd1d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But LH, HB are also double of HB; therefore KB is equal to LH, HB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但LH,HB也是HB的两倍,因此KB等于LH,HB。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-2.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-13-2","revisionId":"euclid-13-2@raw-30e08735f5ddb824","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9abea083ab29e1cd3160bbc8a5d6dc83807a2a244f9d4eeef0edea8079db64f6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the whole gnomon MNO was also proved equal to the whole CG; therefore the remainder HF is equal to BG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但整个曲尺形 MNO也证明等于整个CG;因此,其余的HF等于BG。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-2.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-13-2","revisionId":"euclid-13-2@raw-30e08735f5ddb824","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"24b2e5e5849e251abdef5c815cb6fd3ac442eca2116b4254fe3aaefa592ac9dc","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And BG is the rectangle CD, DB, for CD is equal to DG; and HF is the square on CB; therefore the rectangle CD, DB is equal to the square on CB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BG是矩形 CD,DB,CD等于DG;HF是CB的正方形;因此,矩形 CD,DB等于CB的正方形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-2.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-13-2","revisionId":"euclid-13-2@raw-30e08735f5ddb824","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"96877bdc5fa08ce052b9052e5ad3e5164361c43c6a9266c8b25a182d268dcf1a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, as DC is to CB, so is CB to BD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,DC对CB的比等于CB对BD的比；DC 与 CB 之比等于 CB 与 BD 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-2.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-13-2","revisionId":"euclid-13-2@raw-30e08735f5ddb824","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6b6d36539d91cf25fd14b2b01fa575931496182b0dd89c53f0bfb133f4ac9613","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But DC is greater than CB; therefore CB is also greater than BD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但DC超过CB,因此CB也超过BD。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-2.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-13-2","revisionId":"euclid-13-2@raw-30e08735f5ddb824","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a520ec0ba7ff99d48dd65350fa7a9b800e58257b5e71678ad94f129e0dd831cd","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, when the straight line CD is cut in extreme and mean ratio, CB is the greater segment."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,当直线CD在黄金分割中被削减时,CB是较大的数量部分。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-2.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-13-2","revisionId":"euclid-13-2@raw-30e08735f5ddb824","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-2.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-13-2","revisionId":"euclid-13-2@raw-30e08735f5ddb824","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"97d4e0ab3d795a733f8427b4594ec22560db6ffaf81e6540d86fed6783b1cd18","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Lemma. That the double of AC is greater than BC is to be proved thus."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"莱玛,AC的两倍大于BC,这一点值得证明。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-2.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-13-2","revisionId":"euclid-13-2@raw-30e08735f5ddb824","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c518c72f9cdf8ae754f3d99d989317dab204e74d9ef349e374c4c0fb532fe2c5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If not, let BC be, if possible, double of CA."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果不是,BC就加倍CA,如果可能的话。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-2.proof.15","contentId":"euclid-13-2","revisionId":"euclid-13-2@raw-30e08735f5ddb824","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 15","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"049dd307ab269b2f62f34f8dae4144e239a2aa5a2729f0e7d241a0aa216083cd","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the square on BC is quadruple of the square on CA; therefore the squares on BC, CA are five times the square on CA."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,BC比正方形是CA比正方形的三倍;BC比正方形比CA是5倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-2.proof.16","contentId":"euclid-13-2","revisionId":"euclid-13-2@raw-30e08735f5ddb824","order":18,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 16","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fc08cfe1f7d6de59d04e7c384912d12a89448c494a504e5ae9d697acc7f89d30","citations":["euclid-2-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, by hypothesis, the square on BA is also five times the square on CA; therefore the square on BA is equal to the squares on BC, CA: which is impossible. [[II. 4](/principles/euclid-2-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,假设说,BA的正方形是CA的正方形的5倍;因此,BA的正方形等于BC的正方形,CA的CA的正方形,这是不可能做到的。 [[II. 4](/principles/euclid-2-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-2.proof.17","contentId":"euclid-13-2","revisionId":"euclid-13-2@raw-30e08735f5ddb824","order":19,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 17","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2777abb37083df053a7493a242102ad98b1546a49d316b8d48f236b5a94d249e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore CB is not double of AC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,CB不是AC的两倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-2.proof.18","contentId":"euclid-13-2","revisionId":"euclid-13-2@raw-30e08735f5ddb824","order":20,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 18","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7ef79307bb52cfab2e65d392b01f0f0af69bbe0150bf3e93e65bee82a4681952","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly we can prove that neither is a straight line less than CB double of CA; for the absurdity is much greater."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,我们可以证明,两个线的长度都低于CA的CB倍;因为荒谬性更大。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-2.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-13-2","revisionId":"euclid-13-2@raw-30e08735f5ddb824","order":21,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b3868b92baf6782299915eb33520b73a804997f3d5e2d84ff7e9c0fd140ff323","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the double of AC is greater than CB. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AC的两倍大于CB,Q,D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-2.source","contentId":"euclid-13-2","revisionId":"euclid-13-2@raw-30e08735f5ddb824","order":22,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"078833aa9c10a8e0c0223e232c7cf7e270947e281fe0251ac144bccc9d9a4d45","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.2/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.2\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-13-2:euclid-6-1:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-13-2","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-13-2.proof.5"],"targetContentId":"euclid-6-1","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.2","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.2/","sourceLabel":"VI. 1"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-13-2:euclid-2-4:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-13-2","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-13-2.proof.16"],"targetContentId":"euclid-2-4","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.2","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.2/","sourceLabel":"II. 4"}}],"incomingEdges":[],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-13-2:euclid-6-1:explicit","id":"euclid-6-1","book":6,"number":1,"kind":"proposition","title":"同高三角形与平行四边形的面积比等于底边比","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-13-2:euclid-2-4:explicit","id":"euclid-2-4","book":2,"number":4,"kind":"proposition","title":"完全平方公式的几何证明","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-ratio","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
